{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22349","headline":"秋怀 · 白居易","name":"秋怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月出照北堂，光华满阶墀。\n凉风从西至，草木日夜衰。\n桐柳减绿阴，蕙兰消碧滋。\n感物私自念，我心亦如之。\n安得长少壮，盛衰迫天时。\n人生如石火，爲乐长苦迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}